# Case (a) of inc-6vrn: Elude Death fires on the MAIN hit of a natural attack
# that carries FT_NATURAL_GRAB, and the sequence must stop there.
#
#   INCURSION_ELUDE_PROBE="burning ghast:1" \
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/elude-death-main.keys 5
#
# The character is the frozen orc warrior of dequ-setup.keys; the options file
# has Elude Death set to SEVEN. The ant is summoned beside him from the wizard
# menu. EludeProbeArrange (src/Player.cpp) then sets his hit points to 1 and
# throws the ant's natural-attack sequence (bite, natural grab, sting). The
# first bite that lands kills him, the "You die... Die?" prompt appears and
# this script answers n. Read by tools/check_elude_death_followup.sh.
@include dequ-setup.keys

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Corporeal Undead"
@choose "burning ghast"
RIGHT ENTER             # summon it east of the player
@until "Die?" .         # the probe attacks at the next tick and the prompt rises
@dump:prompt
n                       # Elude Death: refuse to die
@until "world shifts" .
@dump:shifted
.
@dump:after
@quit
